                <pb facs="0931" n="921" sameAs="frus:frus1948v08/pg921"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">125.0093/12–848: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Stuart</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Nanking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1948-12-08">December 8, 1948</date>.<lb/>[Received December 8—6:30
                        a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2450. Marine plane with last group Nanking dependents departed today at 0730.</p>
                <p>Sent Manila 54, repeated Department 2450.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stuart</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
